  "build_note": "The M8 port benchmark (bench/pin.json is M1's). The benchmark and the fuzzers aren't built (Google Benchmark, libFuzzer), so they stay out of the port; nor is the install step, since Corrosion's imported crates can't join snappy's CMake export set."
